## Interface: 16001, 120105
## Title: |cffC9A24ATwich|rUI Layouts
## Notes: Layout packages for TwichUI. Loaded only when a layout is installed, checked or restored; keep it turned on alongside TwichUI.
## Author: twichie
## Version: 1.0.0
## RequiredDeps: !!!TwichUI
## LoadOnDemand: 1
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\!!!TwichUI\media\icon
## X-License: MIT (code); see !!!TwichUI\LICENSE
## Category: Interface Enhancements

# docs/layouts/ has the contract. No saved variables of its own: the install record is TwichUIDB.layouts (the core's).
# Pure parts first (no game calls): the canonical form and fingerprint, the package checks, the composer, the screen layer
Canon.lua
Package.lua
Compose.lua
Geometry.lua

# The two adapters: TwichUI's own settings, and the EllesmereUI suite through its partner-installer functions
AdapterTwichUI.lua
AdapterEllesmere.lua

# The pieces inside the components, for the preview (pure: the same position math the install uses, plus sample sizes)
Elements.lua

# The install record (TwichUIDB.layouts.install) and the pipeline: plan, apply, verify, restore, and the check after a reload
Journal.lua
Engine.lua

# Capturing an author's settings through the adapters' allowlists, publishing a package (an envelope around it that is checked
# again by whoever reads it), and the short, bounded record of the packages kept for sending and installing
Capture.lua
Publish.lua
Store.lua

# The packages: the developer test package, and the Adventure package with Classic and Compact Adventure (the captured
# data of each, then the package that uses them)
TestPackage.lua
ClassicData.lua
CompactData.lua
Classic.lua

# /tui layout (last: it tells TwichUI the layout tools are ready)
Dev.lua
